  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3207.02 Limited Authorizations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3207.02 Limited Authorizations. Allowances used for compliance with this program shall only be used in a designated compliance year by being in a compliance account as of the allowance transfer deadline, or by being transferred into the compliance account by an allowance transfer submitted by the allowance transfer deadline.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
